            </button-visual-state>
          </button>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='37500' id='12' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='50000'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b2b3d' fontsize='14'>Key Insights</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4a5568' fontsize='14'>- The charging infrastructure spans 67 countries with over 9700 stations and majority of stations are operational.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4a5568' fontsize='14'>- Most vehicles maintain high battery health(approx 88% SoH) and healthy charge levels(approx 78% SoH) indicating good overall EV performance.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4a5568' fontsize='14'>- Preventive maintenance represents the largest share of maintenance activities while corrective and emergency maintenance occurs much less frequently.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4a5568' fontsize='14'>- Freight volumes vary significantly across commodity groups with a few commodities accounting for majority of transportation demand.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='1' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
